      "kind": "concept",
      "body": "A CUBE root asks: what number, multiplied by itself three times, gives this result? ∛27 = 3 since 3³ = 27. Perfect cubes to know: 1, 8, 27, 64, 125 (from 1³, 2³, 3³, 4³, 5³).",
      "figure": "square-vs-cube-solutions"
    },
